doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22680102"
url: "https://pardistaghavi.github.io/actionsplice-website/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/PardisTaghavi/ActionSplice"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: "ActionSplice edits an active world-model rollout when the control input changes during sampling. Its Counterfactual State Transport corrector updates the backbone-native state at the current solver step, allowing sampling to resume without replaying completed evaluations."
keywords:
  - interactive world models
  - action conditioning
  - video generation
  - counterfactual state transport
  - diffusion models
